---
// Metrics2: dark brand panel with a heading on the left and a 2x2 grid of stats on the right.
---

<section class="bg-bg py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="grid gap-12 rounded-card bg-brand-950 px-8 py-12 text-white shadow-xl shadow-brand-950/20 ring-1 ring-white/10 sm:px-12 sm:py-16 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-10">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-300">The quiet payoff</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">Calm is measurable.</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 max-w-md text-lg leading-relaxed text-brand-100/80">Teams that plan in Halcyon spend less of the week talking about work and more of it finishing things. The numbers below come from our 2026 customer survey of 1,180 teams.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/about" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 self-start rounded-button bg-white px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-950 transition hover:bg-brand-100">
          <span>Read customer stories</span>
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 12h14" />
            <path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <dl class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-card bg-white/10 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-2 bg-brand-950 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <dt class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-100/70">saved per person, every week</dt>
          <dd class="font-display text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">11h</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-2 bg-brand-950 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <dt class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-100/70">fewer recurring status meetings</dt>
          <dd class="font-display text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">3.4×</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-2 bg-brand-950 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <dt class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-100/70">of projects delivered on time</dt>
          <dd class="font-display text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">94%</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-2 bg-brand-950 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <dt class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-100/70">average time to set up a first project</dt>
          <dd class="font-display text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">9 min</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
